### 001 not-a-page
request: GET action.php
status: 200
content-type: text/html; charset=UTF-8
set-cookie: PHPSESSID=<value>; path=/
cache-control: no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate
length: 107
body:
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>Not a Page</title></head><body><h1>This is not a page.</h1></body></html>
